<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIAN PREMIERSHIP RESULT.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIAN PREMIERSHIP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of an Australian rugby</p>
<p>league premiership playoff match on Sunday.</p>
<p>St George  36  Sydney City  16</p>
<p>Semifinal schedule:</p>
<p>Saturday, September 21: North Sydney v St George</p>
<p> Sunday, September 22:   Manly v Cronulla</p>
